Disgusting?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:25.670
Having a human form, when I am not one.

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:28.190
I find that irrational.

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.260
An irrational shape is disgusting.

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:38.760
Only if I had been beautiful and well-refined, down to the minute details, just like you...

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:43.400
Trinthia, aren't you a general-purpose type?

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:48.510
To seek possibilities together with humans,

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:54.810
to be close to humans, and be together with them, is how you may fulfill your purpose.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:17:00.660
You must have been created to be accepted by humans.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:09.720
Your figure, an existence that was born out of need, has its own meaning.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:13.170
That is the desired necessity.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:17.050
I've never thought of something like that before.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:21.290
Isn't it hard to see yourself?

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.250
That may be.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:26.170
You are worthy of respect.

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:29.770
I am happy I was able to meet you.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:35.070
Um, if it's not troubling for you, may I come again?

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:40.580
Talking to you is very calming for me.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:49.150
That is impossible.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:50.460
I am sorry.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.420
Why is it? Am I troubling you?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:59.050
No, spending time with you is calming for me as well. However...

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.640
I will be launched tomorrow.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:09.060
To send the space probe that was contained inside me into orbit.

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.360
No way...

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:14.810
But I do not fear that.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:19.640
I do find it regretful that a future with you will cease to exist.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:25.160
In a different sphere, I am excited about the launch.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:26.830
Why?

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:31.040
Didn't I tell you? I was born for that purpose.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.870
I am here because I was needed to do so.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:41.930
I was needed by humans, and I pride myself for being able to fulfill that need.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.710
Even if that means they will dispose of you?

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:48.290
Being disposed of has its own meaning as well.

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:51.410
There is also a meaning in not disposing as well.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.440
It's just another type of meaning.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:56.830
So...

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:00.780
I shall go into space.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:05.970
Even if I know that it is a journey I shall never return from...

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:10.120
I shall do so, to fulfill my duties as needed.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.480
Homura I...

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:16.420
This is good bye, Trinthia.

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:20.080
Goodbye, proud one.

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:28.190
Small and beautiful one, you have increased my meaning many times by meeting me.

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:36.110
The encounter with you will affect all who shall be involved with you and me.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:40.490
That is the child between you and me.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.380
I shall depart.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:01.930
Yes.4

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.640
The world is full of meaning.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.530
Nothing is...

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:26.130
meaningless.

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:50.350
And,

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:55.770
So has the treatment of the holy mother, Hasegawa Takuto, been decided on, Professor Havalov?

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.940
Regardless of his character,

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:03.160
the holy mother which produces gods and devils will destroy its balance

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.410
and lead to the destruction of the world.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.300
An immediate removal.

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:14.500
Giving all those requests to Sakuma, and checking on the holy mother gives me this result?

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.930
It's just an issue of possibility.

00:21:18.930 --> 00:21:22.440
Dangerous factors must be immediately removed.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.970
Well, don't be rash.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.680
How did you get in here?

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.660
Rash, you say?

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:33.320
Why?

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:36.390
The reason why you are here should be the same.

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:42.010
Well, we have been constantly observing the holy mother's actions but,

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:47.710
it seems that the man named Hasegawa still hasn't awakened as the holy mother.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.700
We have no intention of complicating matters.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:54.180
What the hell are you...

